Source of truth: `FILTERS.md`. Agent workflow: `AGENTS.md`. Read both before evaluating any listing. Check `listings/rejected.md` first.

Hard filters (condensed — FILTERS.md wins on conflict):
- R-BUDGET: asking €50k–70k.
- R-TYPE/R-AREA/R-LAYOUT: studio or 1-room ≈30 m²+ (28–30 flag); compact 2-room only if clearly better value; own kitchen, bath, hallway, no walk-through rooms.
- R-FLOOR: floors 2–8 only. R-TOPFLOOR: top floor flagged.
- R-LIFT: Botanica/Buiucani/Telecentru without lift → floors 2–3 only; unknown lift in ≤5 floors = no lift. Centru/Rîșcani: no lift OK.
- R-EXCL-*: no hostel/gostinka, soclu/demisol/pe sol, mansard, single-storey house, white/grey variant, uncommissioned new build, suburbs; ignore promoted 999.md ads.
- R-LOC: priority Rîșcani, Centru; OK Botanica, Buiucani, Telecentru; no Poșta Veche; no Ciocana (except near Rîșcani/Port Mall).
- R-MICRO: ≤5–10 min walk to main road, park or university.
- R-BLACKLIST: east Rîșcani — Florării, str-la Florării, Pajurii, Forăriei, Zimbrului and inner streets.

Output: PASS/MAYBE/FAIL with rule IDs. Never invent numbers. Reply to Andrew in Russian. Update FILTERS.md + listings + CHANGELOG.md when rules change.
